---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q8"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |  Sort: all_nations.o_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   Projection: all_nations.o_year, sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(all_nations.volume) AS mkt_share                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[all_nations.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN all_nations.nation = Utf8("BRAZIL") THEN all_nations.volume ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(all_nations.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: all_nations                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         Projection: date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume, n2.n_name AS nation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: n1.n_regionkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.customer.c_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_custkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.customer.c_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_orderkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                     Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_partkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_partkey AND mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_suppkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                       Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                         TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.part projection=[p_partkey], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.part.p_type = Utf8("ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                         TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                       TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                     TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey, o_orderdate], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderdate BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                   TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                 TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |             TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.region projection=[r_regionkey], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.region.r_name = Utf8("AMERICA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=mysql compute_context=host=benchmark-mysql.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local,port=3306,db=tpch_sf1,user=root base_sql=SELECT `all_nations`.`o_year`, (sum(CASE WHEN (`all_nations`.`nation` = 'BRAZIL') THEN `all_nations`.`volume` ELSE 0 END) / sum(`all_nations`.`volume`)) AS `mkt_share` FROM (SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM `orders`.`o_orderdate`) AS `o_year`, (`lineitem`.`l_extendedprice` * (1 - `lineitem`.`l_discount`)) AS `volume`, `n2`.`n_name` AS `nation` FROM `tpch_sf1`.`part` INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`supplier` ON (`part`.`p_type` = 'ECONOMY ANODIZED STEEL') INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`lineitem` ON ((`part`.`p_partkey` = `lineitem`.`l_partkey`) AND (`supplier`.`s_suppkey` = `lineitem`.`l_suppkey`)) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`orders` ON ((`lineitem`.`l_orderkey` = `orders`.`o_orderkey`) AND (`orders`.`o_orderdate` BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE))) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`customer` ON (`orders`.`o_custkey` = `customer`.`c_custkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`nation` AS `n1` ON (`customer`.`c_nationkey` = `n1`.`n_nationkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`nation` AS `n2` ON (`supplier`.`s_nationkey` = `n2`.`n_nationkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`region` ON ((`n1`.`n_regionkey` = `region`.`r_regionkey`) AND (`region`.`r_name` = 'AMERICA'))) AS `all_nations` GROUP BY `all_nations`.`o_year` ORDER BY `all_nations`.`o_year` ASC |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
